    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-zone-title-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1558,
      "width": 2340,
      "height": 32,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "C. 治理变更、紧急控制与同租户版本迁移",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-deploy",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 275,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "1 / DeployTenant：固定 11 笔 CREATE\n预绑定 Factory/Controller 及其他合约地址\n固定编译/依赖，部署账号 chainId/nonce 检查\nmanifest 标记 planned，须核验真实收据/代码/getter\n初始 routesPaused=true，池未登记，普通额度为零\n部署者不保留管理员权限"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-prepare",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 275,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "2 / PrepareActivation：只生成提案，不广播\n核对实际 manifest、runtime hash 与固定绑定\n16 + token数量 项激活 calldata\n登记 Treasury/Clearing/Quarantine/Cold\n明确路由 + 各资产额度，最后恢复路由\n默认走 Clearing；直达 Treasury 归集默认关闭"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-activate",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1700,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 275,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "3 / Council → TenantTimelock\nscheduleBatch → 等待至少两天 → executeBatch\n原子执行：登记、路由、额度、恢复\n等待期提案改变须重新排队\nTimelock 禁止把 delay 降到两天以下\n后台按真实治理收据和最终状态验收"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-treasury",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "4 / Treasury 转冷提案（规划）\nTransferPermit.kind = Rebalance\ndestination = 登记 Cold\nTRANSFER_SIGNER 精确批准\n高于金额阈值另需 Council"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-transfer",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "5 / Treasury.transferCustody\nonlyExecutor；在线签名+必要多签\nrouteEpoch / policyEpoch / 双边 epochs\n无 HOLD/暂停；登记路由和代码 hash\n消费一次性 operationId"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-limits",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "6 / 普通转冷原子检查\n源余额 ≥ reserve + Treasury底线\n源/目标当前开放\nPoolRegistry.consumeLimit\n与提现、冷池回款共用预算"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-cold",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "7 / Cold 受限保管\n精确转入金额 + TreasuryTransferred\n不提供任意外部付款\n不接受 EOA/Safe 代替受控 ColdVault\n后端只记资产位置迁移"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-return",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 1130,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "8 / Cold.returnToTreasury\nkind = Rebalance；目标登记 Treasury\nTRANSFER_SIGNER + Council 每笔必需\nDomain = Milon Cold / 1\n任何金额都需要独立离线共同批准"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-check",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 1130,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "9 / 回款当前控制\n源/目标全局与资产 epochs\nrouteEpoch / policyEpoch / 未暂停\n源余额覆盖剩余 reserve\n消费共享普通出金额度"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-event",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 1130,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "10 / 精确回款 + ColdReturned\n消费 operationId / 转账同事务\n失败全部回滚，授权仍可能有效\n规范链最终事件与状态核对\nPG 更新 movement / Outbox"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-back",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1130,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#e3fafc",
      "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "11 / 返回登记 Treasury\n为本租户提供已批准流动性\n用户总负债不变化\n双向调拨分别消费共享预算\n不能把链上预留当作可支付资本"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-emergency",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 400,
      "backgroundColor": "#fff0f0",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "Guardian 即时收紧 / 暂停\nHOLD、SECURITY_PAUSED、提高 reserve\nsetRoutesPaused(true)、tightenLimits\n撤销 executor / 停用 asset\n不能解除 HOLD、降 reserve 或恢复路由。\n重要：routesPaused 只拦需 route 的移动，\n不阻断 Treasury.executeWithdrawal。\n全面停止提现须用相应风险控制/额度。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-governance",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 400,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "Council / Timelock 的变更权限\nCouncil：逐案 releaseHold、减少 reserve、\n专项处置与必要共同签名。\nTimelock：角色/额度/资产/池登记、路由修改、\nSECURITY_PAUSED 恢复；延迟至少两天。\n改路由前先暂停，修改后 routeEpoch 增加；\n扩权和恢复不走 Guardian 在线捷径。\nsigner/asset/policy 改变撤销相应旧授权。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-migration",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1660,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 400,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "同租户版本迁移（规划 + 合约）\n先终结旧池在途授权并最终对账。\nTreasury.transferCustody(kind=Migration)：\nTRANSFER_SIGNER + Council，仍检查风险/预算。\nClearing.settle 到 Clearing：Council，保留 maturity。\n新 Treasury 不继承旧 requestId 去重映射。\nCold/Quarantine 无普通 Migration 路由。\n旧地址持续监听；不依赖销毁后原址升级。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-note0",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2220,
      "width": 2320,
      "height": 85,
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "API 重点：租户不自选 Treasury、签名密钥、路由或 calldata；资金调度/治理属于受限内部 command。\n变更后后端重载 ABI、代码清单和 epoch，再批准新授权；部署模拟产生的 planned manifest 不能当作生产已部署证据。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:02.612Z",
      "version": 1
    },
